# Keep the build context small and secret-free.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.kombai
infra/.local
backups
*.dump
*.log

# Secrets / local env — NEVER bake into an image (apps/api/.env is a dev file).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
deploy/*.env

# Not needed to build either image
docs
*.md
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
